### Env: choose "local" in REST Client (status bar) so {{baseUrl}} resolves — see ../http-client.env.json

### Create category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "CASA",
  "displayName": "Casa"
}

### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json

# ### Get category by ID
# GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
# Accept: application/json

# ### Update category
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
# Content-Type: application/json
# Accept: application/json

# {
#   "code": "FOOD",
#   "displayName": "Food & Dining"
# }

# ### Delete category
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}
# Accept: */*
